# astrion-skill v1
goal: Surface a random note from your history (memory jog)
trigger:
  - phrase: "random note"
  - phrase: "surprise me"
  - phrase: "memory jog"
do: |
  Pick a random note from the user's Notes app history (excluding
  notes from the last 7 days — we want OLDER memories). If none
  qualifies, pick any random note. Open it in the Notes app. Show
  a notification "From X days ago." No edits — read-only surface.
constraints:
  level: L1
  budget_tokens: 150
  reversibility: FREE
